{"stories":[{"d":"Waking up in a world that's a mishmash of many different realities our protagonist has only one thought: How To Make It Work For Him","i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/39753452-b841-4837-8378-65a577f62ce9.png"],"likeCount":325,"ta":["overlordanime","frieren","konosuba","reincarnatedasaslime","andmore","chaosgacha","noplayers","nonazarick","villianmc","rapistmc","haventreachedityetbutitwillcomeabout"],"cht":1788347144434,"p":12777,"isLive":true,"t":"Chaos In The New World","u":[{"_id":"vJmPtf4gGK9jxsEEK","n":"dhp386"}],"w":42697,"contentRating":"nsfw","rInteract":"medium","nextLive":1788336000000,"ut":1788348116245,"_id":"GDFgAZujPhDeFDziW"},{"d":"[Sequel to A Voice Like Thunder] A man wakes up in a Library, watched over by a machine. Both man and machine recognize one another, but both will eventually have to confront a painful truth; They aren't the people they believe each other to be. This truth will either destroy their bond, or make it stronger than ever before.","i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/21494344-fd0f-452c-8d70-a8ed41843265.gif"],"likeCount":141,"ta":["projectmoon","libraryofruina","nobledark","scifi","cyberpunk","weaktostrong","maleprotagonist","plotbeforesmut","action","deckbuilding","haglust","qmisaslug"],"cht":1788345097513,"p":58736,"isLive":true,"t":"AVLT 2: Tears in Rain","u":[{"a":"https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/702eff91-360d-44b7-81d2-b2e918090c60.jpg","_id":"i6ofHR9Dv8EHMTDPD","n":"gresh"}],"w":190613,"hype":1,"contentRating":"nsfw","rInteract":"none","nextLive":1788336000000,"ut":1788348116179,"_id":"vTxHLYmRdzLNijzwQ"},{"d":"Mike was the ultimate loser.\n\nTwenty-three tournaments. Twenty-three first-round losses. A childhood sweetheart who secretly slept with his best friend for over a year. When he finally caught them, they didn’t even pretend to feel guilty — they laughed at him and called him weak.\n\nThat night should have broken him.\n\nInstead, it became the last day he lived as a loser.\n\nFor the past year, Mike had been hiding a secret. A System. While everyone still saw him as the same pathetic failure, he had been training in silence, rewriting his body, his skills, and his mindset. The prestigious S-University didn’t accept him out of pity — he earned his place by knocking out every opponent who stood in his way.\n\nNow the real story begins.\n\nWith the System guiding him, Mike starts taking everything he was denied. Women who once wouldn’t glance at him. Rivals who looked down on him. Status, strength, and desire.\n\nEve. Mia. And many more.\nThis time, he won’t ask for respect.\nHe’ll take it.","t":"From Loser to Dominator [LTD]","u":[{"_id":"G4xc6SmMhcJyeL4Ty","n":"kdaddy"}],"w":2315,"i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/52dc0131-8ba0-4bb1-b1f4-d17a793e6633.jpg"],"contentRating":"teen","ta":["smut"],"cht":1788259541407,"ut":1788348115795,"_id":"fdqaqm8EsKQxZbPmm"},{"d":"Gotham is a terrible place to live, especially as a sickly girl with a missing brother. But after nearly dying, and awakening to strange powers, you might just have a chance to turn things around.","i":["https://cdn6.fiction.live/file/fictionlive/00453667-dd96-4061-8b01-888331cf0abd.jpg"],"likeCount":9,"ta":["dc","femaleprotagonist","superpowers","submc","bimc","gotham","plotbeforesmut"],"cht":1788317577996,"p":930,"isLive":false,"t":"DC: Unbroken Chains","u":[{"a":"https://ddx5i92cqts4o.cloudfront.net/images/1eo23p2hn_aaahhhh.JPG","_id":"3NMrRPCrJjKwGk7CQ","n":"acatknight"}],"w":22291,"contentRating":"nsfw","nextLive":1788314400000,"ut":1788348109047,"_id":"ANL7wfSRPhGtuTWug"},{"d":"Your home is in danger, and you must take up your Ancestral war machine to defend it. Break your enemies, and crush them under the armored boot of your Battlemech.","i":["https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1g8s58qot_1653157536072.jpg"],"likeCount":346,"ta":["battletech","mechwarrior","peripheryrats","fuckcomstar","bastardizedsystem","kingarthursmechs"],"cht":1788041043737